This plan allows the visitor to visit Meiji Shrine, then walk to Yoyogi Park, followed by a stroll along Harajuku's Takeshita Street. After lunch at Tsukemen Gyoza no Ohsho, they visit Shinjuku Gyoen National Garden, and finish the day with a visit to Omoide Yokocho. Each venue is open at the scheduled times, and the time between stops is sufficient for walking between them.
